 "summary": "The PR adds one definition, `Polygon.inscribed`, with its body not exposed, plus its characteristic API: `inscribed_apply` (simp, proved by `(rfl)`), `inscribed_finRotate` and `edgeSet_inscribed`, which need periodicity and so correctly carry no simp attribute. The private helpers are tailored to this proof (`3 * \u03b4` windows, parameters in `Icc 0 T`), the two main theorems are the right exports, and there is no compatibility surface.",
